video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span>A Martial Fantasy Roguelike Rooted in Eastern Lore</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >400+ Handcrafted Cards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >172 Inner Skills</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >54 Mystical Elixirs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Random Events</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ Unique Enemies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20 Ascending Difficulty Levels</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Modes of Play</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yao Hunt Tournament</strong> \u2013 Team up with friends and race to cleanse the land</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yao-Hunter\u2019s Edict</strong> \u2013 Daily global challenges with ranked leaderboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom Mode</strong> \u2013 Tailor your adventure with custom seeds and rules</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Steam Workshop Now Available!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>[Experimental Features \u2192 Workshop]</strong> menu to install community mods and create your own martial myths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Official Discord:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["M\u00f2Games"],"dlc":[2432560,3654180],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1915510/e9bd4c56f88da596de468c52b648fcf878de3956/header.jpg?t=1762984919","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></u